{"hw":"ὀλιγόω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ὀλιγόω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ὀλιγόω</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">lessen, diminish,</b> <span class=\"gk\">ἐν ἀπειλῇ -ώσεις γῆν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">LXX</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Hb.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.12</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἔτη ἀσεβῶν -ωθήσεται</span> ib.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Pr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">10.27</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ὠλιγώθη ἡ ψυχὴ αὐτοῦ</span> his soul <b class=\"lex-tr\">was grieved,</b> ib.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Jd.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">10.16</span> </span>,al.</div></div>"}